      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If you created the world, you need to disable the UI and UiMenu layers in the mirrors. If the world is not created by you, it is recommended to try to contact the creator to fix the issue\n\nThis is not a VRChat bug and is more of an oversight from the world creator. It is why the UI doesn't show up in your personal mirrors",
