  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I am having an issue with my UI being rendered in world mirrors, I do not know how to turn this off, I have searched everywhere for a solution and cannot find one. This is an issue with MMD dance worlds that allow me to record, my camera shows up on the screen/mirror of that world as well. \n\nMy camera does not show up in my personal mirrors. ONLY the WORLD mirrors. It has NEVER done this before up until 3 days ago.. and it's doing it. Again it NEVER did it before. EVER. it does not matter the world I am in, new, old, beta, whatever.. it doesn't matter. it does it now. It never did before. NEVER DID BEFORE I cannot make that clear enough. \n\nI have tried uninstalling the game, I have nuked app data.. I have done everything I can think of..",
